 <h3>Share</h3>
 ${link ? `<p>Any logged-in user with this link can read this note:</p><p><code>${esc(link)}</code></p>
-<form method="post" action="/notes/${n.id}/unshare">${csrfField(req)}<button>Stop sharing</button></form>`
-: `<form method="post" action="/notes/${n.id}/share">${csrfField(req)}<button>Share</button></form>`}
-<p><a href="/">← All notes</a></p>`));
+<form method="post" action="/notes/${n.id}/unshare">${csrf}<button>Stop sharing</button></form>`
